WEBVTT - Mythduel: Thor vs Zeus (original work)

00:01.000 --> 00:05.000
<v THOR>[b01] This storm answered neither horn nor hymn. I claim the right to loose it.

00:06.000 --> 00:10.000
<v ZEUS>[b01] No sky above any sea is yours alone, northman. Name your terms.

00:11.000 --> 00:16.000
<v THOR>[b01] First blood honourably taken ends it. The sky goes free, whatever falls.

00:19.500 --> 00:23.500
<v ZEUS>[b02] You circle like a bear around a fire. Come and test the weather.

00:30.000 --> 00:34.500
<v THOR>[b02] Wind first, then iron. I read you by your footfalls, Olympian.

00:42.000 --> 00:45.500
<v THOR>[b03] Now!

00:49.000 --> 00:53.500
<v ZEUS>[b03] A good swing. Too honest. I felt it coming off your shoulder.

01:01.000 --> 01:05.000
<v ZEUS>[b04] Let the sky choose between us. Throw, and call it back.

01:14.000 --> 01:18.500
<v THOR>[b04] Mine returns to my hand. Pray yours remembers your name.

01:25.000 --> 01:29.000
<v THOR>[b05] Stand and take it, then. Shoulder to shoulder.

01:37.000 --> 01:41.500
<v ZEUS>[b05] You hit like a falling mast. I yield you that, and nothing else.

01:47.000 --> 01:51.500
<v ZEUS>[b06] It turns on us both. Together, northman, or we feed the sea.

01:57.000 --> 02:01.500
<v THOR>[b06] Back to back, then. The sky can wait its turn.

02:12.000 --> 02:16.000
<v ZEUS>[b07] Your ribs betray you, old lion. I see the opening.

02:22.000 --> 02:26.500
<v THOR>[b07] Aye. And I see that you see it. Strike, if honour lets you.

02:31.500 --> 02:36.000
<v ZEUS>[b08] The opening was mine, and I spend it on mercy. Loose it with me.

02:42.000 --> 02:47.000
<v THOR>[b08] Together, then. Out to sea, where no roof burns and no sail breaks.

